DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
25577::$$$message_0186_0000_0000$$$::There's a gaping hole in my chest.[lr]::
25578::$$$message_0186_0000_0001$$$::Something warm spills from the wound, and something cold invades the void it leaves.[lr]::
25579::$$$message_0186_0000_0002$$$::It's frightening, but also gentle.[lr]::
25580::$$$message_0186_0000_0003$$$::   This is death.[lr]::
25581::$$$message_0186_0000_0004$$$::A gentle darkness containing a slight mixture of pain and relief.::
25582::$$$message_0186_0001_0000$$$::Eight days before the Fifth Holy Grail War was set to begin...[lr]::
25583::$$$message_0186_0001_0001$$$::I arrived in Fuyuki City and began my preparations for the conflict.[lr]::
25584::$$$message_0186_0001_0002$$$::I learned the lay of the land and chose a location to use as my hideout.[lr]::
25585::$$$message_0186_0001_0003$$$::I prepared to the best of my ability, and summoned a Servant.[lr]::
25586::$$$message_0186_0001_0004$$$::The process was unlike anything I'd undertaken before. My heart pounded in my chest.[lr]::
25587::$$$message_0186_0001_0005$$$::It wasn't the thrill of battle.[lr]::
25588::$$$message_0186_0001_0006$$$::There were two things about it that made me enjoy my job for the first time.::
25589::$$$message_0186_0002_0000$$$::You said that I should go on a voyage.[lr]::
25590::$$$message_0186_0002_0001$$$::That I should see the wide world.::
25591::$$$message_0186_0003_0000$$$::Feeling timid and unsure that he would be satisfied with me as his contractor...[lr]::
25592::$$$message_0186_0003_0001$$$::My Servant addressed me.::
25593::$$$message_0186_0004_0000$$$::"A long time ago, I fought side by side with a woman warrior.[lr]::
25594::$$$message_0186_0004_0001$$$::You remind me of her."[lr]::
25595::$$$message_0186_0004_0002$$$::He gave me a grin that made me feel like a fool for worrying at all.::
25596::$$$message_0186_0005_0000$$$::I wasn't betrayed.[lr]::
25597::$$$message_0186_0005_0001$$$::They just never had any doubt in their hearts.[lr]::
25598::$$$message_0186_0005_0002$$$::There was no substance to me. I never decided the "self" that I needed to have once I became an adult.::
25599::$$$message_0186_0006_0000$$$::I never had anything like conviction.[lr]::
25600::$$$message_0186_0006_0001$$$::I armored myself in the guise of an independent person, without ever growing my inner self.[lr]::
25601::$$$message_0186_0006_0002$$$::My naked self was weak and cowardly, and I'd been pessimistic about the world my entire life.::
25602::$$$message_0186_0007_0000$$$::My father once said that I treated each day like work.[lr]::
25603::$$$message_0186_0007_0001$$$::He'd given up on me.[lr]::
25604::$$$message_0186_0007_0002$$$::I couldn't feel hope, so I passed the days hopelessly.[lr]::
25605::$$$message_0186_0007_0003$$$::But I was afraid of it all.[lr]::
25606::$$$message_0186_0007_0004$$$::I wanted to be rewarded more than anyone, and yet I pretended to be wise and kept lying to myself.[lr]::
25607::$$$message_0186_0007_0005$$$::In reality, I could have enjoyed my life like anyone else, but I chose to ignore that fact because I would lose it all eventually.::
25608::$$$message_0186_0008_0000$$$::Actually, I... I...[lr]::
25609::$$$message_0186_0008_0001$$$::I found that side of myself very comforting/I wanted to conquer my weakness...[lr]::
25610::$$$message_0186_0008_0002$$$::I was resigned/I couldn't bear...[lr]::
25611::$$$message_0186_0008_0003$$$::to live my life/to live on...[lr]::
25612::$$$message_0186_0008_0004$$$::with such miserable feelings/with such intolerable thoughts.::
25613::$$$message_0186_0009_0000$$$::...I must confess,[lr]::
25614::$$$message_0186_0009_0001$$$::I didn't want to die.::
25615::$$$message_0186_0010_0000$$$::   And, I would fall here.[lr]::
25616::$$$message_0186_0010_0001$$$::I'd tasted hell again and again,[lr]::
25617::$$$message_0186_0010_0002$$$::fallen into a pit made from the resentment of the dead, of their hatred for the living.::
25618::$$$message_0186_0011_0000$$$::This place is suffocating.[lr]::
25619::$$$message_0186_0011_0001$$$::It's nothing like the relief I felt moments ago.[lr]::
25620::$$$message_0186_0011_0002$$$::Dying is torturous enough, but suffering here after each death is going to drive me mad.[lr]::
25621::$$$message_0186_0011_0003$$$::No matter how many times I experience it, the few minutes between my death and resurrection make me want to puke.[lr]::
25622::$$$message_0186_0011_0004$$$::The first time I experienced this, I called it hell.::
25623::$$$message_0186_0012_0000$$$::[font italic=true]"...I don't know if 'hell' is the right word for it, but it made me feel filthy.[font italic=false][lr]::
25624::$$$message_0186_0012_0001$$$::[font italic=true]The dead aren't supposed to be conscious. A regular dead person wouldn't feel anything about it, but someone conscious would feel utter torment."[font italic=false]::
25625::$$$message_0186_0013_0000$$$::...But I was wrong.[lr]::
25626::$$$message_0186_0013_0001$$$::This isn't hell. It isn't the place where the dead fall.[lr]::
25627::$$$message_0186_0013_0002$$$::My hell, my resurrection, was the relief I felt earlier.[lr]::
25628::$$$message_0186_0013_0003$$$::So this... I've known all along that this is his...::
25629::$$$message_0186_0014_0000$$$::"Ahh... [wvl canskip=false time=800]You're right.[lr]::
25630::$$$message_0186_0014_0001$$$::Well, shit. It doesn't feel like anything special to me. I just woke up feeling this way. It might be because you're human, and I'm a Servant. Though..."::
25631::$$$message_0186_0015_0000$$$::His original place.[lr]::
25632::$$$message_0186_0015_0001$$$::How he existed before donning the mantle of Aŋra Mainiiu.[lr]::
25633::$$$message_0186_0015_0002$$$::This is where he was before he made a pact with me.[lr]::
25634::$$$message_0186_0015_0003$$$::And it's the world of falsehood he'll return to once our pact is over.::
25635::$$$message_0186_0016_0000$$$::Still, he doesn't find it wretched at all.[lr]::
25636::$$$message_0186_0016_0001$$$::A human like me would only feel misery, but it's nothing at all to him.::
25637::$$$message_0186_0017_0000$$$::These memories are his everyday life.[lr]::
25638::$$$message_0186_0017_0001$$$::Imprisonment. Plunder. Abuse. Contempt. Eternal...emptiness.[lr]::
25639::$$$message_0186_0017_0002$$$::A space beyond hate, where even one's sense of self is lost, and he had affirmed mankind's ugliness.[lr]::
25640::$$$message_0186_0017_0003$$$::A completely empty, pure land, without joy or sadness, much less hatred.[lr]::
25641::$$$message_0186_0017_0004$$$::The life of a young man, whom they called All the Evil in the World.::
25642::$$$message_0186_0018_0000$$$::So many blanks are filled in.[lr]::
25643::$$$message_0186_0018_0001$$$::Once the painting is complete, he'll just go back to that place.[lr]::
25644::$$$message_0186_0018_0002$$$::Even if it's made-up, this Holy Grail War is his ideal world.[lr]::
25645::$$$message_0186_0018_0003$$$::...I don't trust him anymore,[lr]::
25646::$$$message_0186_0018_0004$$$::so why is he trying to put an end to this dream...?::
25647::$$$message_0186_0019_0000$$$::"......"[lr]::
25648::$$$message_0186_0019_0001$$$::I open my eyes.[lr]::
25649::$$$message_0186_0019_0002$$$::This was the most vivid "death" I've experienced so far, but I feel calmer than I've ever felt before.[lr]::
25650::$$$message_0186_0019_0003$$$::[se storage=se600.wav]No, I'm just wrapped in stillness. Mentally frozen.[lr]::
25651::$$$message_0186_0019_0004$$$::My intellect and emotions are halted. Right now, I bet I could do anything.::
25652::$$$message_0186_0020_0000$$$::"Hey, you're awake, Master. Good to see you so calm."[lr]::
25653::$$$message_0186_0020_0001$$$::I see Avenger in the corner of the room, absorbed in his usual puzzle.[lr]::
25654::$$$message_0186_0020_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
25655::$$$message_0186_0020_0003$$$::...I feel annoyed.[lr]::
25656::$$$message_0186_0020_0004$$$::He's my familiar, but he doesn't do anything I want.[lr]::
25657::$$$message_0186_0020_0005$$$::He's always been a shapeless shadow, so maybe I should just stuff him into a bug box.::
25658::$$$message_0186_0021_0000$$$::"Oh, looks like you're still raring to go. You bounce back quick, actually. It's like getting killed by that ex-Servant didn't even faze you."[lr]::
25659::$$$message_0186_0021_0001$$$::He snickers.[lr]::
25660::$$$message_0186_0021_0002$$$::"Ngh..."[lr]::
25661::$$$message_0186_0021_0003$$$::A cold fire blazes in my frozen mind.[lr]::
25662::$$$message_0186_0021_0004$$$::It isn't his foul mouth I can't forgive, but the way he pretends to be evil.::
25663::$$$message_0186_0022_0000$$$::"Why, Aŋra Mainiiu? [lr]::
25664::$$$message_0186_0022_0001$$$::I'm not the only one who wishes for this Holy Grail War. There should be someone who wants it more than me right now.[lr]::
25665::$$$message_0186_0022_0002$$$::I just...don't understand. We're supposed to have the same wish, [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]so why are you trying to end it!?"::
25666::$$$message_0186_0023_0000$$$::I shout, clenching my fists.[lr]::
25667::$$$message_0186_0023_0001$$$::I want to know how he feels, more than I care about his betrayal.[lr]::
25668::$$$message_0186_0023_0002$$$::But he...[lr]::
25669::$$$message_0186_0023_0003$$$::"What a drag. I'm tired of this."[lr]::
25670::$$$message_0186_0023_0004$$$::He dismisses me.[lr]::
25671::$$$message_0186_0023_0005$$$::Even now, he completely erases how he feels.::
25672::$$$message_0186_0024_0000$$$::"...Avenger."[lr]::
25673::$$$message_0186_0024_0001$$$::"Stop glaring at me like that. Aren't you satisfied by now? You got to enjoy and taste pretty much every part of your Holy Grail War.[lr]::
25674::$$$message_0186_0024_0002$$$::But there's nothing you need here... [l][say storage=snplg12_anr_0042 name=アンリ]I'm going to commit a violation of familiar rules by bringing this up, but I think it's about time.[lr]::
25675::$$$message_0186_0024_0003$$$::...Let's cancel our pact, Master. Let's end this."::
25676::$$$message_0186_0025_0000$$$::Avenger extends his hand, knowing the significance of what he's saying.::
25677::$$$message_0186_0026_0000$$$::I can't do that.[lr]::
25678::$$$message_0186_0026_0001$$$::We've had our share of disagreements...[lr]::
25679::$$$message_0186_0026_0002$$$::...but I can't let go of his hand once I've taken it.::
25680::$$$message_0186_0027_0000$$$::"Avenger, can you still see me?"[lr]::
25681::$$$message_0186_0027_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
25682::$$$message_0186_0027_0002$$$::For just an instant, his body flickers.[lr]::
25683::$$$message_0186_0027_0003$$$::...I knew it.[lr]::
25684::$$$message_0186_0027_0004$$$::He's almost completely returned to the void.::
25685::$$$message_0186_0028_0000$$$::"...Hmph. Just so you know, I don't want to end this Holy Grail War. I have no intention of returning to my dead body."[lr]::
25686::$$$message_0186_0028_0001$$$::"Okay. If that's what my Master wants, then I have no choice but to continue the pact. But that means you'll end up actually winning the Holy Grail War, and then you'll have to destroy the Grail itself."::
25687::$$$message_0186_0029_0000$$$::"Wha... How could I do that!?"[lr]::
25688::$$$message_0186_0029_0001$$$::"You can. He did it once already.[lr]::
25689::$$$message_0186_0029_0002$$$::I told you, this is a reenactment of the Fifth Holy Grail War. It shouldn't come as a surprise that the person who destroyed the Holy Grail would do that once they reach the Holy Grail."::
25690::$$$message_0186_0030_0000$$$::"...I see. So that's..."[lr]::
25691::$$$message_0186_0030_0001$$$::Avenger's final trump card.[lr]::
25692::$$$message_0186_0030_0002$$$::No, it's the way he intended to end this all along.::
25693::$$$message_0186_0031_0000$$$::"Avenger."[lr]::
25694::$$$message_0186_0031_0001$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
25695::$$$message_0186_0031_0002$$$::The black shadow sticks to the wall.[wait canskip=0 time=300][se storage=se067.wav][quake vmax=30 hmax=10 time=500][lr]::
25696::$$$message_0186_0031_0003$$$::"...I wish we'd done this sooner.[lr]::
25697::$$$message_0186_0031_0004$$$::You're my Servant, but you're far too disobedient."::
25698::$$$message_0186_0032_0000$$$::I won't give him a chance to fight back.[lr]::
25699::$$$message_0186_0032_0001$$$::Maybe if I use a Command Spell[line len=2]oh, there's no cage here to trap him in[line len=2]okay, then I'll...[lr]::
25700::$$$message_0186_0032_0002$$$::"You're going to [font italic=true]become my left arm.[font italic=false]"::
25701::$$$message_0186_0033_0000$$$::"Ha... Haah, hah, hah..."[lr]::
25702::$$$message_0186_0033_0001$$$::With this, he can't go see the victory of the Holy Grail War on his own anymore.[lr]::
25703::$$$message_0186_0033_0002$$$::I don't want to die.[lr]::
25704::$$$message_0186_0033_0003$$$::I don't want to kill him.[lr]::
25705::$$$message_0186_0033_0004$$$::In that case...I just need to protect the Holy Grail.::
25706::$$$message_0186_0034_0000$$$::"Hah... Haah, hah... I won't dissolve our pact.[lr]::
25707::$$$message_0186_0034_0001$$$::...Aŋra. If you're aiming to end this world, then that makes you my enemy."[lr]::
25708::$$$message_0186_0034_0002$$$::Now, let the Holy Grail War continue.[lr]::
25709::$$$message_0186_0034_0003$$$::The Holy Grail is mine.[lr]::
25710::$$$message_0186_0034_0004$$$::This wish is mine.[lr]::
25711::$$$message_0186_0034_0005$$$::I won't let anyone break it.::
925642::$$$message_9186_0018_0000$$$::So many blanks are filled in.[r]::

